        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Areas of use",
          "gen": true
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "Repair of damage and defects in concrete substrates",
            "Structural and non-structural repairs (class R4)",
            "Repairs where frost resistance and a dense mortar are required, also in marine environments"
          ],
          "gen": true
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Application",
          "gen": true
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "Clean the surface of dust and loose particles and pre-wet absorbent substrates. No free water may remain",
            "Mix 3.2-3.45 litres of water per 25 kg bag with a machine for 2-3 minutes, let it rest for 3 minutes and mix again",
            "If needed, apply a bonding layer of Redisit or Mapepoxy L and apply the mortar wet-on-wet",
            "Apply by hand with a trowel or by spray, 3-40 mm per layer. Pot life about 20 minutes at +20 °C"
          ],
          "gen": true
        },
